    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλαξ-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span>) <i>the milky way</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
